   "en": "§ The mishna continues: «Rabbi Eliezer says: Even if she brought him a hundred maidservants,» he may compel her to make thread from wool, since idleness leads to licentiousness. «Rav Malkiyyu said» that «Rav Adda bar Ahava said:» The «halakha is in accordance with» the opinion of «Rabbi Eliezer.»"
  }
